# 📝 To-Do List App (JavaScript CRUD)

## 📌 Project Overview

This is a simple **To-Do List Web Application** built using **HTML, CSS (Bootstrap), and JavaScript**.
It allows users to manage daily tasks with basic CRUD operations.

---

## 🚀 Features

* ➕ Add new tasks with description
* 📋 Display all tasks in a table
* ✏️ Edit existing tasks
* ❌ Delete tasks
* ⚡ Simple and responsive UI using Bootstrap
* 💼 LocalStorage

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3 (Bootstrap 5)
* JavaScript (Vanilla JS)

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```
project-folder/
│
├── index.html     # Main HTML file
├── style.css      # Custom styling
└── script.js      # JavaScript logic
```

---


## ⚙️ How It Works

* Tasks are stored in a **JavaScript array**
* Each task contains:

  * Task name
  * Description
* When a task is added, edited, or deleted:

  * The UI updates dynamically using DOM manipulation

